<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title><%= title %></title>
<style><%- reportCss %></style>
<style>
  /* 택일 리포트 — 주제별 심층 리딩과 같은 크림·남색 톤. 예전 다크 테마 1쪽짜리(추천일 한 줄 +
     문단 3개)에서, 엔진이 계산한 달 전체 점수·시간대·히트맵을 먼저 보여주는 구성으로 바꿨다. */
  html, body.ds-report { background: #faf8f4; }
  body.ds-report { color: #29394b; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.78; }
  .ds-report .chapter { padding: 16mm 23mm 16mm; }
  .ds-report .ds-header { padding: 11mm 12mm 10mm; margin: 0 0 8mm; border-radius: 5mm; background: #24344b; color: #fff; break-inside: avoid; }
  .ds-report .ds-brand { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 7mm; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17); font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .07em; }
  .ds-report .ds-brand .edition { color: #dfca95; font-weight: 400; }
  .ds-report .ds-header .eyebrow { margin: 8mm 0 2mm; color: #e4cb92; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .ds-report .ds-header h1 { margin: 0 0 7mm; color: #fff; font-family: 'ReportMyeongjo','Batang','바탕',serif; font-size: 23pt; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.32; }
  .ds-report .ds-header .meta { padding-top: 6mm; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17); color: #cbd5df; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ds-report .ds-header .meta b { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
  .ds-report .sec-label { margin: 8mm 0 3mm; color: #6d846f; font-size: 8.5pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .ds-report h2.sec { margin: 0 0 5mm; padding-bottom: 3mm; border-bottom: 1px solid #24344b; color: #24344b; font-family: 'ReportMyeongjo','Batang','바탕',serif; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .ds-report .ds-heading { margin: 7mm 0 2.5mm; padding-bottom: 1.5mm; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e1d9; color: #24344b; font-family: 'ReportMyeongjo','Batang','바탕',serif; font-size: 12.5pt; font-weight: 700; break-after: avoid; }
  .ds-report .ds-body p { margin: 0 0 5mm; color: #354457; text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; }
  .ds-report mark { background: linear-gradient(transparent 56%, #f3d78a 56%); color: #14233a; font-weight: 700; padding: 0 .4mm; }
  .ds-report .gloss { color: #697586; }
  .ds-report .vz-verdict .h { font-size: 20pt; }
  .ds-report .vd-sub { color: #2f6a5e; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .ds-report .vd-alts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2mm; margin-top: 4mm; }
  .ds-report .vd-alts span { padding: 1.5mm 3mm; border-radius: 2mm; background: #f7f3e8; color: #5d6776; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  .ds-report .disclaimer { margin-top: 9mm; border-top-color: #e3e1d9; color: #78838e; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ds-report .imprint { color: #7a663c; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  .ds-report .best-plain { margin: 0 0 8mm; padding: 6mm 7mm; border: 1.5px solid #c7a13a; border-radius: 4mm; background: #fff; text-align: center; }
  .ds-report .best-plain .label { color: #8a6a1f; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; }
  .ds-report .best-plain .value { margin-top: 2mm; color: #1d2c40; font-family: 'ReportMyeongjo','Batang','바탕',serif; font-size: 19pt; font-weight: 700; }
  <%- visualCss %>
</style>
</head>
<body class="ds-report">

<section class="chapter">
  <div class="ds-header">
    <div class="ds-brand"><span>사주보는 수달</span><span class="edition">DATE SELECTION</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow"><%= eyebrow %></div>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <div class="meta"><%- metaLine %></div>
  </div>

  <% if (parts) { %>
    <%- verdictHtml(parts.verdict, bestLabel || '가장 좋은 때') %>
    <%- parts.cards %>
    <div class="sec-label">01 · 숫자로 보는 선택지</div>
    <h2 class="sec">왜 이 날인지, 한눈에</h2>
    <% parts.panels.forEach(function(x){ %>
    <div class="vz-panel">
      <div class="ttl"><%= x.title %><% if (x.sub) { %> <small><%= x.sub %></small><% } %></div>
      <%- x.html %>
      <% if (x.cap) { %><p class="cap"><%- x.cap %></p><% } %>
    </div>
    <% }); %>
    <div class="sec-label">02 · 풀이</div>
    <h2 class="sec">추천일을 이렇게 쓰세요</h2>
  <% } else if (bestValue) { %>
  <div class="best-plain"><div class="label"><%= bestLabel %></div><div class="value"><%= bestValue %></div></div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="ds-body">
  <% sections.forEach(function(s) { %>
    <% if (s.heading) { %><h3 class="ds-heading"><%= s.heading %></h3><% } %>
    <p><%- renderMarkup(s.body) %></p>
  <% }) %>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer">
    이 리포트는 명리학적 통계 경향에 근거한 참고 자료이며, 의학적·법적·재정적 조언을 대체하지 않습니다.
  </p>
  <div class="imprint" style="margin-top:6mm; text-align:center;">길잡이 여울</div>
</section>

<script>window.__chartsReady = true;</script>
</body>
</html>

